    "description": {
      "value": "<p><em>Overlay (midi-qol):</em> offered as your reaction when a creature within 60 feet casts a spell (midi's reaction trigger <em>a creature within its range casts a spell</em>, after the spell's slot is spent and before anything is rolled). The caster makes the Constitution save; on a failure its spell fails: no attack, save, damage or effects, and the spell slot it used isn't expended. Only a spell with Verbal, Somatic or Material components (its reaction condition reads the spell being cast). Not checked: that you can see the caster.</p>",
